        {
          "text": "Pele takukooyooba mudima kuliyooyo iwakapengede. Kumatalikilo wakacita kuti nyika ya-Zebuloni aya-Nafitali isampaulwe, pele kuma­ manino wakailetela bulemu, nkukuti cisi cakulwizi, kutala lya-Jordano, Galilaya wabamasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
