        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo iswe twazyalilwa mwana, twapegwa mwana mulombe. Bwsendelezi buyookala azifunzi zyakwe, Nkabela izina lyakwe liyooambwa kuti, Sinkuta uugambya, Leza Singuzu, Tateesu Uuteeli, Mwami waluumuno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
