        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.2.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 2:44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.1.32+LUK.1.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 1:32-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwami bwakwe buyookomenesya, alwalo luumuno talukooyoomana, acuuno cabwami ca-Davida abweendelezi bwakwe. Uyoobubusya akubwiimya nji alubeta abululami kuzwa kuciindi ecino mazuba oonse mane kukabe kutamani. Busungu bwa-Jehova wamakamu mbobuti cite aya makani oonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami wakatuma mulazyo kuli-Jakobo, wakamvwigwa mucisi ca-­Israyeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bantu boonse bayoouziba, ba-Efraimu abaabo bakede mu-Samariya. Mukulikankaizya kwabo amukulisumpula kwamyoyo yabo balaamba kuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zitina zyawa, pele tuyooyasya mabwe aabezedwe; mikuyu yagonkwa pele tuyoobika misamu yakedari mucibaka cayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kako Jehova ulababusizya basinkondonyina babo, akubinzya basikubalwisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ba-Aramu bakunembo aba-Filisti bakusule, boonse bayooluma ba-Israyeli cakuvundika, Aya makani oonse aba, nekubaboobo bukali bwakwe tabuna kumana, ijanza lyakwe licitandabikidwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
